@!internal

module nupp.runtime.provider

--[[
Built-in implementations of Nupp runtime service contracts.

Application code imports the public facades; setup code imports the handles in
[](nupp.runtime.services.contracts) or the individual host contract modules.
The artifact catalog registers these implementation modules without requiring
them. A facade's top-level assembly loads the selected implementation once.

These modules are internal implementation details. Third-party providers target
the public contract interfaces and shared types rather than depending on these
records, native handles, helper functions, or module names. Each implementation
owns only the resources described by its contract and initializes independently
in every Lua state.
]]
